      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns8AAAABA4kp7A",
      "title": "Add MAIN (Main's World) on World Chain",
      "author": "pxpn-dev",
      "number": 1356,
      "body": "Adds `MAIN`, the ERC-20 token of Main's World, on World Chain.\n\n- **Contract:** `0xe734c938260e5E96088EE36110b0dFf1AeFF528e` ([Worldscan](https://worldscan.org/token/0xe734c938260e5E96088EE36110b0dFf1AeFF528e), [Blockscout](https://worldchain-mainnet.explorer.alchemy.com/token/0xe734c938260e5E96088EE36110b0dFf1AeFF528e)) — source verified.\n- **Chain:** `worldchain` only. The token is native to World Chain and has never been bridged from L1, so `nobridge: true` is set.\n- `name`, `symbol` and `decimals` in `data.json` are the literal on-chain values (`Main's World` / `MAIN` / `18`).\n- Logo is a 256×256 SVG.\n\n`pnpm validate --datadir ./data --tokens MAIN` passes locally with no errors and no warnings.\n\nMain's World is a map-based social mini app inside World App where every account is a World ID-verified human. Requesting the `worldchain` label for World team review.",
